{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"636020443219886091","content":"\"Skitters...\" Baeshra frowns thinking of where to  begin. \"Skitters good boy. Much better now. Skitter small shy when Baeshra first meet Web and Skitter in London. Baeshra spend small more time with Skitter than Web. Web stay in sewers much. Answer spider prayers. Baeshra stay up on roofs. That's where Skitters lived before fish-boat. In box on roofs. Skitters like mouse. Quiet, sneaky, shy. Skitters have mouse too. Squeak.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T10:17:02.404000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738339365444517888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
